  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Respuestas cortas de acuerdo**",
      "",
      "| Frase original | Para estar de acuerdo | Para decir 'yo no' |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| **Afirmativa** (*I love it.*) | ***So do I.*** / ***Me too.*** / ***I do too.*** | ***I don't.*** / ***Really? I don't.*** |",
      "| **Negativa** (*I don't like it.*) | ***Neither do I.*** / ***Me neither.*** / ***I don't either.*** | ***I do.*** |",
      "",
      "**El auxiliar debe coincidir con el tiempo de la frase original**",
      "",
      "| Frase | So / Neither |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| *I **am** tired.* | ***So am I.*** |",
      "| *I **like** pizza.* | ***So do I.*** |",
      "| *I **went** to Paris.* | ***So did I.*** |",
      "| *I **have** seen it.* | ***So have I.*** |",
      "| *I **can** swim.* | ***So can I.*** |",
      "| *I **will** go.* | ***So will I.*** |",
      "| *I **don't** know.* | ***Neither do I.*** |",
      "| *I **haven't** finished.* | ***Neither have I.*** |",
      "| *I **can't** swim.* | ***Neither can I.*** |",
      "| *I **wasn't** there.* | ***Neither was I.*** |",
      "",
      "**Estructura:** *So / Neither + auxiliar + sujeto.* Las dos son afirmativas por la inversión (no se pone *not*).",
      "",
      "**Alternativa con too / either (orden normal)**",
      "",
      "- *I love it. — I do **too**.* (afirmativa)",
      "- *I don't love it. — I don't **either**.* (negativa)",
      "",
      "**Ojo:** ✘ *So I do* (orden incorrecto) · ✘ *Neither I do* · ✘ *Neither don't I* (doble negación). *Me too* / *Me neither* son coloquiales y válidos. *Either* (negativo) vs *too* (afirmativo): ✘ *I don't like it too.*",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *neither* /ˈnaɪðə/ o /ˈniːðə/ · *either* /ˈaɪðə/ o /ˈiːðə/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "So I do.",
        "right": "So do I.",
        "note": "Invierte: auxiliar + sujeto."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "Neither don't I.",
        "right": "Neither do I.",
        "note": "Neither ya es negativo."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
